  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhERjH18ktdlIOFm29WSOcqZ4XyPUI3h2HrZ7bLcsUTa1KA4u7ANcQpwh6mLXJ5Hi1HOopxFSreVZntEBYY03dUknYjF-2jvSpp35QRJQ_btcDI_soWSX05s5cgjdoDstKl1x_8whKvz_LeDwh_CKbb2iqaBXOEd5QlKImFuCTdFsAE3aBLAgMo0DcLaw/s1421/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhERjH18ktdlIOFm29WSOcqZ4XyPUI3h2HrZ7bLcsUTa1KA4u7ANcQpwh6mLXJ5Hi1HOopxFSreVZntEBYY03dUknYjF-2jvSpp35QRJQ_btcDI_soWSX05s5cgjdoDstKl1x_8whKvz_LeDwh_CKbb2iqaBXOEd5QlKImFuCTdFsAE3aBLAgMo0DcLaw/w450-h640/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><h3 style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/bong342-kape.html\" target=\"_blank\">封面作品</a><br /><br /></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/342e.html\" target=\"_blank\">編輯室ê話</a><br /><br /></span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">做伙來唸詩</span></h3><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><div>陳建町<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/tioh.html\" target=\"_blank\">逐家tio̍h起--來</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>1</div><div><br /></div><div>蔡天享<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_5.html\" target=\"_blank\">名字——記「貞愛親王殿下御上陸紀念之碑」</a></div><div>2</div><div><br /></div><div>黃靜惠<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/kai.html\" target=\"_blank\">上kài好</a></div><div>3</div><div><br /></div><div>黃子佳<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/e_5.html\" target=\"_blank\">早起時ê樂暢</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>4</div><div><br /></div><div>鄭如絜<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/e_97.html\" target=\"_blank\">秋ê跤步</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>5</div><div><br /></div><h3>阿瑞--ā話仙</h3><div>藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/lan-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">Lán ê 大自然環境</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>7</div><div><br /></div><h3>台語sa攏有講座</h3><div>主講／邱毓斌</div><div>記錄／李家銓<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_6.html\" target=\"_blank\">解嚴前後青年反抗運動</a><br />8</div><div><br /></div><h3>寶島好食mi̍h</h3><div>陳柏宇<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_94.html\" target=\"_blank\">冬瓜雞湯</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>10</div><div><br /></div><div>李麗華<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/ekap.html\" target=\"_blank\">宜蘭ê米粉羹、魚丸kap草仔粿</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>11</div><div><br /></div><h3>逐家來phò-tāu</h3><div>蕭文興<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/ai-tshingai-ping.html\" target=\"_blank\">做雞ài tshíng，做人ài píng</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>12</div><div><br /></div><div>林榮淑<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_12.html\" target=\"_blank\">野生囡仔時</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>14</div><div><br /></div><div>鄭麗香<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_26.html\" target=\"_blank\">拍斷手骨顛倒勇</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>15</div><div><br /></div><h3>Lán來講看māi</h3><div>洪以芯<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/tsiok.html\" target=\"_blank\">學台羅tsiok重要</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>17</div><div><br /></div><div>主講／陳豐惠</div><div>記錄／田永承<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_15.html\" target=\"_blank\">做伙來讀台語繪本</a></div><div><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>18</div><div><br /></div><div>Lîm Hiân-tông<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2022/10/bee-rusyn.html\" target=\"_blank\">爭取bē著名份ê <i>Rusyn</i>語</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>20</div><div><br /></div><div>林秀珍<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/e_17.html\" target=\"_blank\">講寡台灣羅馬字協會對高中教育ê拍拚</a></div><div><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>40</div><div><br /></div><h3>地名研究室</h3><div>黃偉嘉<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/he-sian-na.html\" target=\"_blank\">屏遮那 （Hē-sian-ná）</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>22</div><div><br /></div><h3>台灣人寫真</h3><div>賴恒黎<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/e_4.html\" target=\"_blank\">阿媽ê結婚相</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>24</div><div><br /></div><div>Lêng Pōe-jû<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_25.html\" target=\"_blank\">榕仔跤</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>39</div><div><br /></div><h3>心內話</h3><div>李玉鳳<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_17.html\" target=\"_blank\">聽老師講故事</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>26</div><div><br /></div><div>張家榮<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_84.html\" target=\"_blank\">恆春囡仔</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>27</div><div><br /></div><div>李芳宴<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/hite.html\" target=\"_blank\">Hit年ê比賽</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>28</div><div><br /></div><div>徐孟妘<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/hoe.html\" target=\"_blank\">Hō͘翁ê情批</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>38</div><div><br /></div><h3>生活ê藝術</h3><div>郭文玄<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_21.html\" target=\"_blank\">一个人</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>30</div><div><br /></div><h3>答喙鼓</h3><div>蘇晏德<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/blog-post_76.html\" target=\"_blank\">關廟三寶</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>35</div><div><br /></div><h3>寫hō͘學生朋友ê代誌</h3><div>陳雷<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/eti.html\" target=\"_blank\">我ê某阿tiⁿ</a></div><div><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/10/eti.html\" target=\"_blank\">Góa ê Bó͘ A-tiⁿ</a></div><div>44</div><div><br /></div><div><b>李江却台語文教基金會捐款徵信</b></div><div>2022年8--月<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>46</div><div><br /></div></div><div><br /></div></span></div><div><span><span><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhOSP1_AfmZjrJdWlzhAkjLE-zkR5z5CP7reUA05joDwyIc1YeBHVzFSkfD5hEZZiap27vD6lEcO9nyd2wY8UvOxAcvVmxILHysLpdbWaEKGdxmzRNCYhgYOxYfP_pbWPL0oVyWhvTbNexePeWG3US54fGvYA2Wsds5--KXdePOpeTqBvKo-UqpRGo__Q/s1424/342%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2%E8%A3%A1.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhOSP1_AfmZjrJdWlzhAkjLE-zkR5z5CP7reUA05joDwyIc1YeBHVzFSkfD5hEZZiap27vD6lEcO9nyd2wY8UvOxAcvVmxILHysLpdbWaEKGdxmzRNCYhgYOxYfP_pbWPL0oVyWhvTbNexePeWG3U